[QuickEntry.tsx:199–208](src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L199-L208), [Settings.tsx:160–165](src/components/Settings.tsx#L160-L165)

Messages fixed popup/overlay nahi hain. Woh [scrollable container](src/components/PullToRefresh.tsx#L63-L69) ke andar normal content hain.

**Neeche scroll karke Save dabane par message upar, visible area ke bahar ho sakta hai.** QuickEntry ka normal message 3 seconds mein clear bhi ho jaata hai. Yeh toast “show nahi hua” ka sabse direct code-level explanation hai.

### 🟠 Messages overwrite hote hain aur tab change par kho jaate hain
[QuickEntry.tsx:137–163](src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L137-L163), [page.tsx:152–159](src/app/page.tsx#L152-L159)

