[Settings.tsx:103–105](src/components/Settings.tsx#L103-L105), [133–134](src/components/Settings.tsx#L133-L134)

Settings ke actions apne timers start karte hain, lekin purana timer cancel nahi hota. Save ke turant baad backup action karne par pehle action ka timer **naya message jaldi clear** kar deta hai. Mocked timer test mein confirm hua.

**Note:** QuickEntry mein previous timer clear hota hai; yeh particular bug Settings mein hai.

