## 3. Background service ke baare mein important clarification

[QuickEntry.tsx:124–166](src/components/QuickEntry.tsx#L124-L166) mein SMS **successful entry-save ke baad native platform par hi** trigger hota hai. Browser/PWA par yeh silently skip hota hai.

Plugin SMS app khole bina send attempt karta hai, lekin **app band/kill hone ke baad pending SMS process/retry karne wali persistent background service ya queue implemented nahi hai**.

Ek additional edge-case bhi mila: [Unicode splitting:121–130](native/android-plugin/com/chakkimitra/plugin/BackgroundSmsPlugin.java#L121-L130) mein fixed 67 UTF-16 units par text cut hota hai; boundary par emoji aane se uska surrogate pair toot sakta hai.

**Verification limit:** Phone-cleaning aur selected save/message flows read-only, in-memory checks se verify kiye. Actual Android/SIM sending aur installed APK test nahi hua. Isliye aapke device par kaunsa SMS issue trigger ho raha hai, uske liye APK build source/version aur Logcat evidence chahiye.
